---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact Us — Shopping Gems" description="Contact Shopping Gems: send deal tips, report price errors, request corrections or discuss partnerships. We reply within 2 business days.">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "ContactPage",
      "name": "Contact Us — Shopping Gems",
      "url": "http://localhost:4321/contact"
    })} />
  </Fragment>
  <p class="my-[18px] text-[13px] text-slate-500"><a href="/" class="hover:text-brand">Home</a> / <span class="text-slate-700">Contact Us</span></p>

  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[2px] text-slate-500">Contact Us</p>
    <h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Found a better price? Tell us.</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-600">Send deal tips, report a wrong date or price, request a correction, or talk partnerships. We read everything and reply within <strong class="text-slate-900">2 business days</strong>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 font-extrabold"><Icon name="tag" cls="h-4 w-4 text-brand" /> Deal tip</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Spotted a live price drop? Send the link — reader tips start many of our guides.</p></div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 font-extrabold"><Icon name="check" cls="h-4 w-4 text-brand" /> Correction</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Wrong date, dead coupon or broken link? We'll fix it and credit you.</p></div>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 font-extrabold"><Icon name="briefcase" cls="h-4 w-4 text-brand" /> Partnership</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600">Brand or store with a genuine offer for readers? Pitch it below.</p></div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 pb-4 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_320px]">
    <div class="min-w-0 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm md:p-8">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold">Send a message</h2>
      <form class="mt-4 grid gap-4" action="mailto:hello@shoppinggems.local" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <div><label for="cf-name" class="mb-1 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">Your name</label><input id="cf-name" name="name" placeholder="Jane Doe" required class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-3 outline-none focus:border-brand focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pearl-aqua-600" /></div>
          <div><label for="cf-email" class="mb-1 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">Email</label><input id="cf-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-3 outline-none focus:border-brand focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pearl-aqua-600" /></div>
        </div>
        <div><label for="cf-topic" class="mb-1 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">Topic</label>
          <select id="cf-topic" name="topic" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 bg-white p-3 outline-none focus:border-brand focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pearl-aqua-600">
            <option>Deal tip</option><option>Correction</option><option>Partnership</option><option>Something else</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div><label for="cf-msg" class="mb-1 block text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">Message</label><textarea id="cf-msg" name="message" rows="5" placeholder="Paste the deal link, the error you found, or your pitch…" required class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-200 p-3 outline-none focus:border-brand focus:ring-2 focus:ring-pearl-aqua-600"></textarea></div>
        <button type="submit" class="w-fit rounded-full bg-brand px-6 py-3 font-bold text-white hover:bg-brand-dark">Send message →</button>
      </form>
    </div>
    <aside class="space-y-6 lg:sticky lg:top-24 lg:self-start">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="mb-2 text-sm font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest">What happens next</h2>
        <ol class="list-decimal space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm text-slate-600">
          <li>We read your message within 2 business days.</li>
          <li>Deal tips get price-checked before publishing.</li>
          <li>Corrections are fixed same-day when verified.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 p-5 text-white shadow-sm">
        <h2 class="font-extrabold">Prefer browsing?</h2>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-300">Today's top picks are already waiting.</p>
        <a href="/deals" class="mt-3 inline-block rounded-full bg-brand px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-white hover:bg-brand-dark">Today's deals →</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <div class="prose-sg max-w-3xl pb-4">
    <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <h3>How fast do you reply?</h3>
    <p>Within 2 business days. Deal tips with an expiry date get priority.</p>
    <h3>Do you accept sponsored posts?</h3>
    <p>We only feature offers we'd recommend to a friend, and anything paid is clearly labeled. Pitch via the form above.</p>
    <h3>Can I request a shopping guide?</h3>
    <p>Yes — tell us what you're buying and your budget, and we'll point you to the right sale or write it up.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
